OL,3,AG20 'family photo' cancelled after
OL,4,Aprotests over presence of Russian
OL,5,Aminister
OL,6,
OL,7,FEuropean diplomats have refused to
OL,8,Fstand for an official photo with
OL,9,FRussia's Foreign Minister Sergei Lavrov
OL,10,Fat the G20 Foreign Ministers' Meeting
OL,11,Fin the US, leading to the American
OL,12,Fhosts cancelling the planned picture.
OL,14,FTwo officials confirmed to the BBC the
OL,15,Fcancellation of the so-called family
OL,16,Fphoto scheduled for Friday morning,
OL,17,Fwhich would usually include
OL,18,Frepresentatives from all the nations in
OL,19,Fattendance.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
