OL,3,AG20 'family photo' cancelled after
OL,4,Aprotests over presence of Russian
OL,5,Aminister
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe meeting, which gathers top
OL,8,Fdiplomats from the world's biggest
OL,9,Feconomies, is being hosted in Atlanta
OL,10,Fby US Secretary of State Marco Rubio.
OL,12,FUkraine is not not a G20 member but has
OL,13,Fbeen invited to similar meetings in
OL,14,Frecent years. However, Ukraine was not
OL,15,Finvited to this meeting.
